{"id":277,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Swellow is very conscientious about the upkeep of its glossy wings. Once two Swellow are gathered, they diligently take care of cleaning each other’s wings."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Swellow flies high above our heads, making graceful arcs in the sky. This Pokémon dives at a steep angle as soon as it spots its prey. The hapless prey is tightly grasped by Swellow’s clawed feet, preventing escape."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It dives at a steep angle as soon as it spots its prey. It catches its prey with sharp claws."},{"games":["X","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"If its two tail feathers are standing at attention, it is proof of good health. It soars elegantly in the sky."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It circles the sky in search of prey. When it spots one, it dives steeply to catch the prey."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A SWELLOW dives upon prey from far above. It never misses its targets. It takes to the skies in search of lands with a warm climate."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Guts","hidden":false,"description":"It's so gutsy that having a status condition boosts the Pokémon's Attack stat."},{"name":"Scrappy","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon can hit Ghost-type Pokémon with Normal- and Fighting-type moves. It is also unaffected by Intimidate."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"grassland","color":"Blue","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":276,"name":"Taillow","condition":null,"children":[{"id":277,"name":"Swellow","condition":"Lv. 22","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Ultra Sun / Ultra Moon","level":[[1,45],[1,64],[1,98],[1,116],[1,365],[1,403],[1,413],[13,17],[17,104],[21,332],[27,501],[33,97],[45,283],[57,179]],"machine":[332,213,590,104,497,263,19,218,416,237,63,182,240,156,216,355,496,214,211,164,241,207,168,92,369,526],"e